  - m_Id: 1899276127363084
    m_Localized: Repair Torpedo Radar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1899276127363085
    m_Localized: Manually Load the Last Torpedo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1899276127363086
    m_Localized: Operate the escape room door using a hydraulic manual valve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1899276127363087
    m_Localized: Register Clue (Check Notes)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1928852060692480
    m_Localized: 'I haven''t been feeling well for a few days.


      Maybe the
      tension all released at once after the escape incident, but <color=#C80000>I
      have a fever that keeps rising, as if I caught a cold</color>. The medical
      staff told me to take sick leave and rest instead of pushing through. I thought
      I would be fine at first, but my body isn''t listening.


      Aaron looks
      even more anxious with me resting. Still, he quietly stayed by my side, bringing
      medicine and meals. I thought he was just fearful, but he turns out to be a
      really good guy.


      Lying in bed, I keep thinking of home. Is Elena doing
      well? Sophia and Lucas are probably asking when Dad is coming back. I need
      to shake off this cold quickly and get back on my feet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2115248352321536
    m_Localized: View Notebook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2115248432013312
    m_Localized: "Project Code\t\t  \nDocument number\t \nDocument Rating\t \nDate
      Created\t\t  \nDepartment of Preparation "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2115248432013313
    m_Localized: "\u25A0 Project Purpose\n\nFor national security and military buildup,
      we aim to analyze \nthe biological characteristics of unidentified organisms
      found \nin the deep sea and apply them to humans to develop \nnext-generation
      combat entities that go beyond existing forces.\n\nThis project is designated
      as a national priority strategic project,\nAll research content is classified
      as the highest level of confidentiality."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2115248432013314
    m_Localized: "\u25A0 Project Overview\n\nOperation Name: ABYSS\n\nDeep-sea creatures
      have their own life structures that can survive even in extreme water pressure,
      low temperatures, and oxygen-deficient environments.\n\nThe researchers develop
      human-strengthening technology using tissues and cells of the organism and
      verify the possibility of manufacturing new weapons that can be used militarily.\n\nThis
      project is carried out at a research facility installed inside a deep-sea research
      submarine."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2115248432013315
    m_Localized: "\u25A0 Plan to secure a subject\n\nClassification of experimental
      subjects: Grade C\n\nTarget acquisition method\n\u25A1 an unidentified personnel\n\u25A1
      Civilians to be processed missing\n\u25A1 Private transfer destination\n\u25A1
      Other Approved Subjects\n\nAll subjects are converted to management targets
      upon arrival at the research facility, and contact with the outside world is
      completely blocked until the project is completed.\n\nThe survival of the subject
      does not take precedence over the purpose of the study."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2115248432013316
    m_Localized: ': ABYSS

      : ABYSS-PRE-001

      : Highest Confidential

      :
      September 4, 2003

      : Special Deep-Sea Research Division'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
